<title>ECUADOR: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>ECUADOR GOVERNMENT LIST (970220)</p>
<p>**************************************************************</p>
<p>* 11 Feb 97 - Congress voted to install Fabian Alarcon as    *</p>
<p>*		 interim president until August 10 1998, when a *</p>
<p>*		 new democratically elected head of state will  *</p>
<p>*		 take over following general elections early    *</p>
<p>*		 next year.						 *</p>
<p>**************************************************************</p>
<p>Interim President (Until 10 Aug 98)............Fabian ALARCON</p>
<p>Vice-President..Rosalia ARTEAGA</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
